"The Gloss is the most potent luck wordchain available to humanity."
"Only Aulia Velra can complete it; it binds all the Avowed of the Velra family together."
"While Glossed, rivals and obstacles melt out of the way of each family member."
"It lasted about three days on the Velras, and bad-luck blowback follows its end."
"Blowback can mean stray meteorites to the face, rare diseases or lost fingers."
"Binding the family together is meant to maximize opportunities and be fairer over time."
"It is not perfect nor limitless, and is not common knowledge."
"Some older Velras can sense the Gloss; it gives a buzzing in the head near family."
"It is a once-in-a-generation chain; Aulia has used it only twice before, as far as anyone knows."
"Its havoc brought lawsuits against the Velras and cost Aulia her council seat."
"Glossed Velras are blamed as accomplices; Aulia plans to pop the remaining Gloss debt."
